<div class="content-box">
    <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-bullseye"></i> What You'll Learn</h2>
    <p>This unit teaches you <strong>Computational Thinking</strong> - a problem-solving toolkit that helps you transform messy, real-world problems into clear, structured solutions.</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Problem Specification:</strong> How to identify stakeholders, define constraints, and set success criteria</li>
        <li><strong>The Four Pillars:</strong> Abstraction, Decomposition, Pattern Recognition, and Algorithmic Thinking</li>
        <li><strong>Flowchart Design:</strong> Using standard symbols to represent logic visually</li>
        <li><strong>Trace Tables:</strong> Testing algorithms by tracking variable changes step-by-step</li>
    </ul>
</div>

